{"title":"2012 AIME II Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Two geometric sequences <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/a/c4a82e7c7dbf7b035a66b5890ec80463b4c3e8d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1, a_2, a_3, \\ldots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/a/cca9b5221ba4288112c1abdf85541050781f21c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_1, b_2, b_3, \\ldots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" /> have the same common ratio, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/4/344f7d79496fb8310a89c823a6ccaf8974a11fa9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 = 27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/9/9a9fb2278c733be5edd896d46a82eb7f1c9410cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_1=99$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/8/bf8216d866e1bbb60c6691b2ad75a42a3df283f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{15}=b_{11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"72\" height=\"17\" />. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/7/fb7904c50fdc103fee44ab630f82383c0b78febc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Call the common ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/9/279a83610a37e3f83bb8d2544695241ca8066834.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> Now since the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />th term of a geometric sequence with first term <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and common ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/e/c2e95828e1bdd4b05dee847cbeb1c53ea90667c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy^{n-1},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"20\" /> we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/6/4165640632c1412aa89c1d3961e8e7e7c2a07372.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 \\cdot r^{14} = b_1 \\cdot r^{10} \\implies r^4 = \\frac{99}{27} = \\frac{11}{3}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"294\" height=\"38\" /> But <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/7/fb7904c50fdc103fee44ab630f82383c0b78febc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/6/ae6a5e74122d90116a8555ba17f18055c3a85e27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 \\cdot r^8 = a_1 \\cdot (r^4)^2=27\\cdot {\\left(\\frac{11}{3}\\right)}^2=27\\cdot \\frac{121} 9=\\boxed{363}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"401\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the ratio be \\( r \\). From \\( \\frac{a_{15}}{b_{11}} = \\frac{a_{15}}{b_{11}} \\):\n</p><p>\\( a_1 r^{14} = b_1 r^{10} \\implies a_1 r^4 = b_1 \\).\n</p><p>Notice how \\( a_5 = a_1 r^4 = b_1 \\).\n</p><p>Then\n</p><p>\\( a_9 = a_5 r^4 = b_1 r^4 = \\frac{b_1^2}{a_1} \\).\n</p><p>Plug in \\( a_1 = 27, b_1 = 99 \\):\n</p><p>\\( a_9 = \\frac{99^2}{27} = 363 \\).\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/2/7c27c665dde9f373508319da9cf042c021c409f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{363}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/V2X9hz6DuUw\">https://youtu.be/V2X9hz6DuUw</a>\n</p><p>~Lucas\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AIME_II\" title=\"2012 AIME II\">2012 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2012 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2012 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2012\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2012 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2012 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:cent